OL,3,AStar Trek actor Walter Koenig, who
OL,4,Aplayed Pavel Chekov, dies aged 90
OL,5,
OL,6,FWalter Koenig, who played the spirited
OL,7,FRussian crewman Pavel Chekov in the
OL,8,Foriginal Star Trek TV series, has died
OL,9,Faged 90.
OL,11,FThe US actor was a mainstay on the show
OL,12,Fas the eager and earnest navigator of
OL,13,Fthe Starship Enterprise, from season
OL,14,Ftwo in 1967 until it ended in 1969,
OL,15,Flater reprising his role in the six
OL,16,Foriginal cast movies from 1979 through
OL,17,Fto 1991.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
