OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AStar Trek actor Walter Koenig, who
OL,4,Aplayed Pavel Chekov, dies aged 90
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the mid-late 1990s, Koenig portrayed
OL,7,Fa very different character, the
OL,8,Fruthless Psi Corps telepath Alfred
OL,9,FBester, in another sci-fi space series,
OL,10,FBabylon 5.
OL,12,FHis Star Trek co-star George Takei led
OL,13,Fthe tributes on social media on Monday,
OL,14,Fwriting: "Walter was more than Chekov.
OL,15,FHe was a writer, a teacher, a
OL,16,Fthoughtful man, and a loyal friend."
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
